          "value": "[{\"q\": \"What is the capacity of the Travel Tumbler TT-400?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 holds 400 ml.\"}, {\"q\": \"What material is the Travel Tumbler TT-400 made from?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 is made of double-wall vacuum-insulated 18/8 stainless steel.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does the Travel Tumbler TT-400 preserve coffee taste?\", \"a\": \"Yes, the Travel Tumbler TT-400 has a ceramic-coated interior so coffee keeps its taste.\"}, {\"q\": \"What type of lid does the Travel Tumbler TT-400 have?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 features a natural bamboo lid with a slide closure.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long does the Travel Tumbler TT-400 keep coffee hot?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 keeps coffee hot for 6 hours.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long does the Travel Tumbler TT-400 keep drinks cold?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 keeps drinks cold for 12 hours.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does the Travel Tumbler TT-400 fit in car cup holders?\", \"a\": \"Yes, the Travel Tumbler TT-400 fits most car cup holders.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you clean the Travel Tumbler TT-400?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 is hand-wash only.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the price of the Travel Tumbler TT-400?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Tumbler TT-400 costs 26 USD.\"}]"
